@startuml
title Routes of the web gateway

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Browser" as B
component "Load balancer" as LB #ECEFF1
component "Identity provider" as KC #ECEFF1
component "Web gateway\n\nanswers itself: /api/v1/me,\nsign-in, sign-out, storefront files" as GW #FFE0B2
component "Catalog service" as CAT
component "Cart service" as CART
component "Order service" as ORD
component "Inventory service" as INV

B --> LB : HTTPS
LB --> KC : /auth/**\nsign-in and\nregistration pages
LB --> GW : everything else
GW --> CAT : /api/v1/products/**\n/api/v1/categories/**\n/api/v1/admin/products/**
GW --> CART : /api/v1/cart/**\n/api/v1/favorites/**
GW --> ORD : /api/v1/orders/**\n/api/v1/admin/orders/**
GW --> INV : /api/v1/admin/stock/**

note bottom of ORD
  The web gateway removes "/api"
  and adds the access token.
end note
@enduml
